<section class="about-position">

  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-header">

      <span class="overline">
        OUR APPROACH
      </span>

      <h2>
        Why We Do Not Install Furnaces
      </h2>

    </div>

    <div class="content">

      <p>
        Every heating company in Whatcom County will tell you they are honest,
        and most of them are. The problem is structural, not personal. When the
        same company that diagnoses your furnace also profits from replacing it,
        there is always an incentive pulling the conversation toward a new
        system.
      </p>

      <p>
        We removed that incentive completely. We repair heating systems and we
        do not sell new ones. There is no version of your diagnosis that pays us
        more. When we recommend a repair, it is because we believe it is the
        right decision. When we believe your furnace has genuinely reached the
        end of its life, we will tell you honestly, explain why, and help you
        understand what to look for in a replacement without trying to sell you
        one ourselves.
      </p>

      <p>
        It is a smaller business model than selling equipment, and that is a
        deliberate choice. We would rather earn long-term trust by giving
        straightforward advice than make a larger profit from a single visit.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

